    - rid: 8629141398965715079
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Names of artists and packs stay as they are; only the headings
          and the last line are translated.
    - rid: 8629141398965715080
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Title of the language screen. Each language is listed by its
          own name, which is not in this table.
    - rid: 8629141398965715081
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Title of the mission map.
    - rid: 8629141398965715082
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = number of the mission. Also the first line of the mission
          card.'
    - rid: 8629141398965715083
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A mission slot that does not exist yet.
    - rid: 8629141398965715084
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Under LOCKED.
    - rid: 8629141398965715085
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Hint line at the foot of a screen. Arrows and ENTER / ESC
